    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Cards that meet all of the conditions below and have unique card numbers can be placed in this card’s Digivolution cards with this card's [On Play] effect. -The cards must be in your hand or trash. -The cards must have [Cyborg] in their traits. -The cards must be red or black Digimon cards. -The cards must be level 5 Digimon cards.",
        "question": "Can you explain in detail which cards I can place in this card’s digivolution cards with this card’s [On Play] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes. The effect reads, “You may trash,” so you can choose not to trash any cards.",
        "question": "When this card is deleted, can I choose not to trash 2 of its digivolution cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
